        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ca73dade-5fc6-437a-b56b-4f2ad7e8ee53\",\"review_text\":\"Vast library of songs.\"},{\"review_id\":\"50f81c3a-bac4-4635-b394-78e284a96268\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app overall so I do not use this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"57c53916-959a-4647-af18-39953dbd5668\",\"review_text\":\"Adds r sometimes annoying n can come 3 times in a row, but other than that it's pretty good. No I'm not buying premium.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b71c4e00-5def-47d0-8425-f5d21fe9cdee\",\"review_text\":\"The Jam feature is so buggy asf, me and my friends can't even enjoy it. My suggestion is instead of sharing \\\"link\\\" or \\\"tap phones\\\", you should be able to invite your friends (that you followed and follows you) directly from the app. Active status would be helpful too, to see when to invite them\"},{\"review_id\":\"e4371e2b-7208-4c1d-bec9-d4e6f860bf7d\",\"review_text\":\"No songs, only home option only their\"},{\"review_id\":\"b60d3235-50be-4ca1-8d65-fe5236a20be6\",\"review_text\":\"It's not letting me open my liked songs, or letting me play any music\"},{\"review_id\":\"d89a4767-4b55-4ae1-948c-8ff820cc2c8f\",\"review_text\":\"Not a good application\"},{\"review_id\":\"3b62b532-35d9-4d67-a559-783835c24fd0\",\"review_text\":\"Pretty amazing songs, podcasts\"},{\"review_id\":\"81a1b315-c2c3-43c1-9ed6-cc92323571af\",\"review_text\":\"I like sounds and you have slot of them\"},{\"review_id\":\"f29918b8-2686-41fb-840b-f9c423cb5042\",\"review_text\":\"Recently they stopped Zee music songs which hits me hard😞\"}]}"
